/* ================================================================
   BAILEY FOOD GIFTS
   PC can bring Bailey a home-cooked meal during an office visit.
   The "Bring Bailey a meal" link only shows when Stockholm > 1 and
   canGiftFood("Bailey") is true. Giving Bailey a meal he likes earns the "Caring for the Caretaker" feat.
   ================================================================ */

:: Bailey Gifts List
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

What would you like to bring Bailey?
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[Give gift (0:05)|Bailey Gifts]]>><<pass 5>><<give_gift "Bailey">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[Reconsider|Bailey Gifts List Reconsider]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts List Reconsider
<<effects>>

Bailey glances up.
<br><br>

<<link [[Back|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food?.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>>
<<wearProp _gift>>

/* ── Beef Wellington ── */
<<if $gift is "beef_wellington">>
	You set the beef wellington on <<his>> desk. The smell is rich and inviting. It's still warm.
	<br><br>
	Bailey's pen freezes mid-motion. <<He>> glances at you first before turning <<his>> attention to the plate, setting <<his>> pen down.
	<br><br>
	"Where did you get the ingredients?" <<he>> asks, not taking <<his>> eyes off the plate.
	<br><br>
	You tell <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	There's a moment of deliberation where Bailey frowns at the food you made. Eventually, <<he>> picks up the fork and knife you set on the plate and cuts <<himself>> a piece.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> takes a bite and chews slowly before <<he>> swallows.
	<br><br>
	<<if $stockholm_active>>
		"Not bad," <<he>> states. "Good work."<<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>>
	<<else>>
		"You can cook," <<he>> comments. "Good."<<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	While staring at something on the computer screen, <<he>> eats the beef wellington bite-by-bite until nothing but crumbs remain. <<He>> pushes the plate back towards you, expecting you to take it.<<pass 15>>
	<br><br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Bailey" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Caring for the Caretaker">>
	<<link [[Take the plate|Bailey Gifts Wellington Take]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave it|Bailey Gifts Wellington Leave]]>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Roast Dinner ── */
<<elseif $gift is "roast_dinner">>
	Bailey raises an eyebrow at the plate of <<recipe_name $gift>> you slid onto <<his>> desk.
	<br><br>
	"Where'd these come from?" <<he>> asks, nodding at the vegetables.
	<br><br>
	You tell <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> takes the fork and stabs a carrot through before bringing it to <<his>> mouth.
	<br><br>
	"It's nutritious," <<he>> comments after swallowing. "Good."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pushes the plate back towards you. "You need this more than I do. Eat."<<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Bailey" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Caring for the Caretaker">>
	<<link [[Share with Bailey|Bailey Gifts Roast Share]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Bailey Gifts Roast Refuse]]>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Spaghetti Bolognese ── */
<<elseif $gift is "spaghetti_bolognese">>
	You slide the <<recipe_name $gift>> onto <<his>> desk.
	<br><br>
	Bailey tilts <<his>> head before reaching for it.
	<br><br>
	"You made this," <<he>> comments. <<He>> spins the plate slightly, as if trying to see it better. "Looks edible. Where did you get the ingredients?"
	<br><br>
	You tell <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> picks up the fork and starts eating. <<He>> doesn't say anything.<<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>><<pass 15>>
	<br><br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Bailey" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Caring for the Caretaker">>
	<<link [[Ask if <<he>> likes it|Bailey Gifts Bolognese Ask]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Remain silent|Bailey Gifts Bolognese Silent]]>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Spicy ── */
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food?.tags?.includes("spicy")>>
	You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Bailey looks at it in your hands. <<His>> lip curls. <<He>> can smell it from where <<he>>'s standing.
	<br><br>
	"It's spicy." Bailey says blankly.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> arms are crossed. <<He>> doesn't touch it.
	<br><br>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(50000, "baileySpicy")>>
		<<link [[Offer <<him>> money to eat it (<<printprice 50000>>)|Bailey Gifts Spicy Money]]>><<money -50000 "baileySpicy">><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">Offer <<him>> money to eat it (<<printprice 50000>>) (You don't have enough money.)</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Give up|Bailey Gifts Spicy Give Up]]>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Drink ── */
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food?.tags?.includes("drink")>>
	You place the <<recipe_name $gift>> on <<his>> desk. <<He>> glances at it. "Did Robin make this or did you?"
	<br><br>
	It didn't seem to matter. Just like <<he>> drank Robin's lemonades and hot chocolates when offered, <<he>> took a sip and set it aside as <<he>> worked.
	<br><br>
	You watch <<him>> work for awhile. Between sessions of typing and clicking at <<his>> computer, <<he>> would occasionally reach over and take another sip.<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
	<br><br>
	You leave <<his>> office and leave <<him>> to work.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Seafood — Bailey hates it ── */
<<elseif $gift is "salmon_wellington" or setup.foodstuff[$gift].food?.tags?.includes("seafood")>>
	You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Bailey's nose wrinkles almost imperceptibly at the sight.
	<br><br>
	"Take it away."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pushes the plate back towards you. <<He>> doesn't seem to like seafood.
	<br><br>
	You leave <<his>> office.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Sweet — Bailey doesn't care for sweets ── */
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food?.tags?.includes("sweet")>>
	Bailey looks at the <<recipe_name $gift>> in your hands. <<He>> looks uninterested.
	<br><br>
	"Take it away," <<he>> says, "before I confiscate it."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> doesn't seem to care for sweets.
	<br><br>
	You leave <<his>> office.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

/* ── Generic rejection ── */
<<else>>
	You hold it out. Bailey glances it over.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> doesn't take it. "Worry about feeding yourself, brat."
	<br><br>
	You leave <<his>> office.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Gifts Bolognese Ask
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I-I'm sorry if it's not good," you say. "I did my best."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"It's rude not to say anything at all you know," you say. "How is it?"
<<else>>
	"Do you like it?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey glances at you, slowly chewing on another forkful of food.
<br><br>

"It's good," <<he>> says bluntly. "The ingredients are clean."
<br><br>

<<He>> finishes eating. <<He>> dabs <<his>> mouth with a handkerchief. <<He>> seems to be more relaxed than <<he>> was before you fed <<him>>.
<br><br>

"It was fine enough," <<he>> says. "Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Bolognese Silent
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<He>> finishes eating. <<He>> dabs <<his>> mouth with a handkerchief. <<He>> seems to be more relaxed than <<he>> was before you fed <<him>>.
<br><br>

"It was fine enough," <<he>> says. "Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Roast Share
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You pick up a fork and knife and slice the roast and vegetables into bite-sized pieces. You eat a bite of meat before placing the fork back down. Bailey picks the fork back up and takes a bite. The two of you continue back-and-forth like this in comfortable silence.<<npcincr Bailey lust 5>><<glust "Bailey">><<pass 15>>
<br><br>

Once the plate is empty, Bailey looks at you.
<br><br>

"It was a filling meal," <<he>> says. "Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Roast Refuse
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I-I made it for you," you murmur. "I already ate."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"This is for you," you clarify. "I already ate."
<<else>>
	"I already ate," you say. "This is just for you."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks at you for a moment before <<he>> shrugs. <<He>> picks up the fork and knife and eats like a soldier would.
<br><br>

"Filling," <<he>> says when <<he>>'s done eating. <<He>> nods at the office door. "We're done here. Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Spicy Money
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"W-What if I gave you <span class="gold"><<printprice 50000>></span>?" you ask. "W-Will you eat it then?"
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You chicken," you say. "Fine, I'll pay you <span class="gold"><<printprice 50000>></span> to eat it."
<<else>>
	"I'll give you <span class="gold"><<printprice 50000>></span> to eat it," you say. "I know you will."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks at the money in your hands and snatches it. <<He>> counts it before tucking it away.
<br><br>

"Fine," <<he>> says, reaching for the <<recipe_name $gift>>. <<He>> takes a bite. Then another.<<npcincr Bailey dom -1>><<set $bailey_dom -= 1>><<ldom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey lust 3>><<glust "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<earnFeat "Caring for the Caretaker">>
<br><br>

Tears well up in <<his>> eyes. <<His>> nose runs. <<He>> drinks a gulp of water to match every bite of food. Despite all that, <<he>> still seems unbothered.
<br><br>

"Happy?" <<He>> asks. <<His>> voice is raw from the spice. <<He>>'s dabbing <<his>> face with a handkerchief. "Get out."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Spicy Give Up
<<effects>>

Discouraged, you take the <<recipe_name $gift>> with you as you leave.
<br><br>

Maybe Bailey would consider eating something spicy if you had enough money.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Wellington Take
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You take the plate, planning to take it to the kitchen sink.
<br><br>

"We're done here." Bailey says, nodding towards the door. "Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Bailey Gifts Wellington Leave
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You leave the plate on Bailey's desk. <<He>> doesn't seem bothered by it.
<br><br>

"We're done here." Bailey says, nodding towards the door. "Go."
<br><br>

You leave <<his>> office.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
